<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="profile-overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="profile-container" class="card-glow" style="width: 95%; max-width: 650px; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(13, 2, 33, 0.92); padding: 50px;">
            <ui:Label name="profile-title" text="HO SO" style="font-size: 44px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 30px; letter-spacing: 2px;" />

            <!-- Avatar -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="profile-avatar-container" class="avatar-ring avatar-ring-gold" style="width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 80px; border-width: 4px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <ui:VisualElement name="profile-avatar" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; justify-content: center; align-items: center;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <ui:TextField name="profile-name-field" label="Ten hien thi" style="font-size: 28px; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px;" />

            <ui:Button name="profile-save-btn" text="LUU" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
            <ui:Button name="profile-close-btn" text="DONG" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 28px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
